      },
      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "JOL",
          "chapter": 2,
          "verse": 18
        }
      ],
      "en": "Then the LORD was jealous for his land, and had pity on his people.",
      "ko": "그 때에 여호와께서 자기 땅을 위하여 중심이 뜨거우시며 그 백성을 긍휼히 여기실 것이라",
      "source_text_hash": "2cc5a947ce5f717c38b93a2f97123f6cfbdcabf630b46a254d2032f70a8d3e30",
      "translation_text_hash": "ffd01614620e5a75d2ce4e5a872267d5379776d780443845c1dc7d97a9ec67fd",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "그 때에 여호와께서 자기 땅을 위하여 중심이 뜨거우시며 그 백성을 긍휼히 여기실 것이라"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "ffd01614620e5a75d2ce4e5a872267d5379776d780443845c1dc7d97a9ec67fd"
